{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"mkdir -p '/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/mind/runs/run-20260426T144402Z--et8g2bwn96/semantic' && cat > '/Users/chrgre01/src/Sapi/verification/example_site/spaces/mind/runs/run-20260426T144402Z--et8g2bwn96/semantic/topic_generation.json' <<'JSON'\n{\n  \\\"topics\\\": [\n    {\n      \\\"topic_id\\\": \\\"topic-mindfulness-attention-mechanisms-and-caveats\\\",\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Mindfulness, attention, and mechanism-level caveats\\\",\n      \\\"structure_type\\\": \\\"wiki\\\",\n      \\\"sections\\\": [\n        \\\"Mindfulness training evidence suggests changes in specific attentional subsystems rather than a single global attentional benefit: MBSR is linked to improved orienting, retreat practice to altered alerting, and prior concentrative experience to baseline conflict-monitoring differences.\\\",\n        \\\"Alpha-band attention research supplies a mechanistic comparison point: selective attention can suppress distracting or irrelevant sensory processing through increased alpha activity in task-irrelevant cortical regions across visual, auditory, tactile, spatial, feature-based, and intersensory contexts.\\\",\n        \\\"The synthesis remains cautious because mindfulness constructs and interventions are heterogeneous, the attention-training study used small groups without active-training controls, and broad mindfulness claims can exceed the specificity of available behavioral and neural evidence.\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-mindfulness-hype-exceeds-evidence--96cb023af909\\\",\n        \\\"claim-mindfulness-definition-is-ambiguous--4f220365d6f4\\\",\n        \\\"claim-mindfulness-training-can-improve-attention-related-behavior-by-changing-specific--f9e8e6ee54d7\\\",\n        \\\"claim-an-8-week-mindfulness-based-stress-reduction-course-improves-endogenous-orientin--f7bde69b7431\\\",\n        \\\"claim-a-1-month-intensive-mindfulness-retreat-among-previously-experienced-meditators--cd2a814c579a\\\",\n        \\\"claim-participants-with-prior-concentrative-meditation-experience-show-reduced-conflic--7b44607a9505\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-attentional-effects-should-be-treated-as-preliminary-because-the-study-used--8a181621f4d7\\\",\n        \\\"claim-alpha-band-oscillations-can-be-actively-invoked-in-cortical-regions-that-process--09466b39d396\\\",\n        \\\"claim-alpha-mediated-biasing-extends-beyond-vision-appearing-in-auditory-and-tactile-s--2cd546facc83\\\",\n        \\\"claim-higher-naturally-occurring-or-experimentally-induced-alpha-power-reduces-visual--3884cfa09119\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-04-mind-the-hype-a-critical-evaluation-and-prescriptive-agenda-for-research-on-mind-w2761197918--79c0d54db997\\\",\n        \\\"source-02-mindfulness-training-modifies-subsystems-of-attention-w2132002500--696402dc8f78\\\",\n        \\\"source-03-the-role-of-alpha-band-brain-oscillations-as-a-sensory-suppression-mechanism-dur-w2005105933--7b6b7d5bc8b9\\\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"topic_id\\\": \\\"topic-operationalizing-conscious-attentional-and-mindfulness-constructs\\\",\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Operationalizing mental constructs across consciousness, attention, and mindfulness research\\\",\n      \\\"structure_type\\\": \\\"wiki\\\",\n      \\\"sections\\\": [\n        \\\"The sources share a concern with converting broad mental concepts into measurable structures: integrated information theory defines consciousness through complexes and phi, attention studies separate alerting, orienting, conflict monitoring, and sensory suppression, while mindfulness research warns against treating mindfulness as a unitary or universally defined construct.\\\",\n        \\\"Measurement choices shape interpretation. Self-report mindfulness scales vary in facets and factor structures, ANT scores depend on predefined cue and target contrasts, alpha studies depend on paradigms that isolate suppression rather than orienting, and integrated information theory depends on identifying informational relationships within a complex.\\\",\n        \\\"A useful topic page would compare how different fields define the target construct, what each measurement captures, and where construct validity remains uncertain rather than merging all mental-state claims into one generic account.\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-mindfulness-definition-is-ambiguous--4f220365d6f4\\\",\n        \\\"claim-self-report-measures-lack-validity--56550542660a\\\",\n        \\\"claim-common-mindfulness-questionnaires-operationalize-different-facets-of-mindfulness--19920139d48a\\\",\n        \\\"claim-existing-mindfulness-self-report-measures-have-unresolved-construct-validity-lim--65891880856d\\\",\n        \\\"claim-research-on-mindfulness-should-shift-from-seeking-one-unitary-mindfulness-measur--210f23dc10a0\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-attention-network-test-separates-alerting-orienting-and-conflict-monitoring--08b2302acb19\\\",\n        \\\"claim-instructional-cuing-paradigms-distinguish-distracter-suppression-from-probabilis--af0b5b81b7e7\\\",\n        \\\"claim-consciousness-corresponds-to-a-system-s-capacity-to-integrate-information-becaus--ca44bbf79dcb\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-quantity-of-consciousness-available-to-a-system-is-measured-by-the-value-of--48abc06d417d\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-quality-of-consciousness-is-specified-by-the-informational-relationships-amo--52a77799b51d\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-04-mind-the-hype-a-critical-evaluation-and-prescriptive-agenda-for-research-on-mind-w2761197918--79c0d54db997\\\",\n        \\\"source-02-mindfulness-training-modifies-subsystems-of-attention-w2132002500--696402dc8f78\\\",\n        \\\"source-03-the-role-of-alpha-band-brain-oscillations-as-a-sensory-suppression-mechanism-dur-w2005105933--7b6b7d5bc8b9\\\",\n        \\\"source-01-an-information-integration-theory-of-consciousness-w2114900706--09db8f102f39\\\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"topic_id\\\": \\\"topic-rigor-safety-and-evidence-limits-in-mindfulness-claims\\\",\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Rigor, safety, and evidence limits in mindfulness claims\\\",\n      \\\"structure_type\\\": \\\"wiki\\\",\n      \\\"sections\\\": [\n        \\\"The mindfulness critique argues that clinical, media, educational, corporate, and military enthusiasm has outpaced an uneven evidence base, with preliminary clinical trials, condition-specific benefits, under-assessed adverse effects, and opportunity costs all limiting broad implementation claims.\\\",\n        \\\"The attention-training source reinforces the need for caution at a smaller scale: reported behavioral attention effects are preliminary because of small groups, lack of active-training controls, behavioral-only measurement, protocol differences, and possible task-repetition effects.\\\",\n        \\\"The resulting cross-source topic is not that mindfulness is ineffective, but that claims about benefits, mechanisms, and safety require precise intervention descriptions, active controls, adverse-event monitoring, preregistration, replication, and modest communication of neuroimaging or behavioral results.\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"claim_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"claim-clinical-evidence-remains-preliminary--117717456958\\\",\n        \\\"claim-therapeutic-benefits-are-condition-specific--201401200700\\\",\n        \\\"claim-adverse-effects-are-undermeasured--25fa20260426\\\",\n        \\\"claim-neuroimaging-requires-caution--201770958900\\\",\n        \\\"claim-research-needs-prescriptive-reform--79c0d54db997\\\",\n        \\\"claim-mindfulness-based-interventions-show-mixed-and-condition-dependent-clinical-effi--ada76b44a400\\\",\n        \\\"claim-meditation-related-adverse-effects-are-under-assessed-in-current-trials-so-claim--ce66cec14da3\\\",\n        \\\"claim-mindfulness-hype-can-create-opportunity-costs-by-diverting-people-from-establish--1a47df8a5e6d\\\",\n        \\\"claim-the-attentional-effects-should-be-treated-as-preliminary-because-the-study-used--8a181621f4d7\\\",\n        \\\"claim-post-training-conflict-monitoring-differences-are-not-detected-among-the-mbsr-re--62de62c3ee08\\\"\n      ],\n      \\\"source_ids\\\": [\n        \\\"source-04-mind-the-hype-a-critical-evaluation-and-prescriptive-agenda-for-research-on-mind-w2761197918--79c0d54db997\\\",\n        \\\"source-02-mindfulness-training-modifies-subsystems-of-attention-w2132002500--696402dc8f78\\\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\nJSON\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
